Usage: tfa_phase2_test.par [options] [TEST] ...

Options:
  --hide-output         Suppress data that tests print to stdout/stderr, and
                        only show it if the test fails.
  -f, --failfast        Stop after the first failure
  -l, --list-tests      List tests and exit
  -r REGEX, --regex=REGEX
                        Regex to apply to tests, to only run those tests
  --logger=<category>=<level>
                        Configure log levels for specific logger categories
  -q, --quiet           Decrease the verbosity (may be specified multiple
                        times)
  -v, --verbosity       Increase the verbosity (may be specified multiple
                        times)
  --profile=PROFILE     Profile the test with cProfile, and write output to
                        the given path
  -?, --help            Show this help message and exit
